      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/rahul7218\">@Rahul7218</a></p>\n<p>The Rejection Reason field must be filled in case of Reject Action is performed by user only by writing Mandatory Depends On condition by customizing respective docytpe (Quotation) as following;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/9/f9fc00d330f3eed7aa7326eb4ceed989ee20a2cc.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/f9fc00d330f3eed7aa7326eb4ceed989ee20a2cc\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/9/f9fc00d330f3eed7aa7326eb4ceed989ee20a2cc_2_690x329.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"zFsNSIdVCZU7yIQP3pgMjmYlcza\" width=\"690\" height=\"329\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/9/f9fc00d330f3eed7aa7326eb4ceed989ee20a2cc_2_690x329.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/9/f9fc00d330f3eed7aa7326eb4ceed989ee20a2cc_2_1035x493.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/9/f9fc00d330f3eed7aa7326eb4ceed989ee20a2cc_2_1380x658.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F6F4F0\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1897×905 79.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>eval:doc.workflow_state == “Rejected”</p>\n<p>AND if you want to throw a message can also be achieved by writing client script.</p>",
